<title>USA: Natick, Mass., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Natick, Mass., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc., said it won $13.455 million of Natick, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.32 percent.</p>
</text>
